graph TD
    subgraph "Brunella Core Host"
        S[Supervisor / Process Manager] -->|Spawns & Monitors| A1[Agent Process 1]
        S -->|Spawns & Monitors| A2[Agent Process 2]
        S -->|Spawns & Monitors| A3[Agent Process 3]
        
        R[Message Router / Hub]
        
        A1 <-->|MCP / JSON-RPC| R
        A2 <-->|MCP / JSON-RPC| R
        A3 <-->|MCP / JSON-RPC| R
        
        DB[(LanceDB Memory)]
